# Allow-list: the production build context contains only what the running app needs. Anything
# not re-included below (.env, runtime databases, attachments, backups, context.md, .claude/,
# .git/, tests, docs, caches) can never reach the image.
*

!requirements.txt
!*.py
!backup/
!collectors/
!deals/
!ebay/
!inventory/
!notifier/
!parser/
!pricing/
!reports/
!sales/
!utils/
!web/
!deploy/entrypoint.sh
!deploy/flipper-cli
!data/listings.json

**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.db
**/*.db-journal
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/.env
**/attachments
**/credentials
